{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51384","headline":"桂花曲 · 李德谷","name":"桂花曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙女侍，董双成，桂殿夜凉（一作「寒」）吹玉笙。\n曲终却从仙宫去，万户千门空月明。\n河汉女，玉练颜，云軿往往到人间。\n九霄有路去无际（一作「迹」），袅袅大风吹佩环。\n《苕溪渔隐业话後集》十二：「战斗曲《许彦周诗话》谓是李卫公作，《桐江诗话》谓是均州武当山石壁上刻之，云神仙所作，未知孰是。\n」（《全唐诗补逸》卷五以前五句作李栖筠诗，未妥，今删彼存此。\n详参书末之修订说明。\n《全唐诗》卷八九○收作李白《桂殿秋》词，恐误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}